<title>UK: BZW sets call warrants on Wolford.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on Wolford.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued five million American-style call warrants on Wolford, lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1350.00 ATS	     PREMIUM	=</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     29.0 ATS		  GEARING	=</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   02.APR.98		 PAYDATE	28.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1350.0 ATS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
